    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\"><strong>Table&nbsp;16.25</strong> Summary of the main features of multiple endocrine neoplasia type&nbsp;1</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Asa SL and Gill AJ",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 489.05pt; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"652\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Feature</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; border: none; border-top: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Syndrome characteristics</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Syndrome MIM number(s)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">131100</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Associated malignant tumours</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">PitNETs, PanNETs, gastrointestinal NETs, thymic carcinoids/NETs, pulmonary carcinoids/NETs, adrenal cortical carcinoma, poorly cohesive carcinoma</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Associated benign tumours</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Parathyroid adenoma, adrenal cortical adenoma, lipoma, angiofibroma, collagenoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cancer-related inheritance</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Autosomal dominant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Chromosome location</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em>MEN1</em> (11q13.1)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 219.75pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"293\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Protein product&ndash;associated pathway</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 269.3pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"359\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">WNT/TGF-&beta; pathway</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">NET, neuroendocrine tumour; PanNET, pancreatic neuroendocrine tumour; PitNET, pituitary neuroendocrine tumour.</p>",
